# Word of Command (CR 723.2): with Bot2's hand empty there is no card to choose and nothing for Bot2 to play; Word of
# Command resolves, and Bot2 is controlled by no one afterwards. Bot2 empties its hand on turn 2 with seven Memnites and a land.

